  - m_Id: 364006586851328
    m_Localized: '"The universal ruler of the wasteland. A perfect balance of speed,
      durability, and firepower. Ideal for those who value flexibility and are ready
      for any challenge."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364315233099776
    m_Localized: '"Faster than the wind, but as fragile as glass. Speed is your best
      friend, hesitation is your worst enemy. Strike and vanish."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364489359630336
    m_Localized: '"A behemoth that keeps moving forward no matter what. Slow but
      unbreakable. The enemy will strike, but you''ll still be standing."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 365174545326080
    m_Localized: '"A proud lord of the wasteland with a touch of heaviness. Reliable
      power with moderate speed, like a knight on the battlefield."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 407862661488640
    m_Localized: Cannot afford...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410273744560128
